01:21:40.460 --> 01:21:40.920
La puerta aquí

01:21:40.920 --> 01:21:41.740
pertenece al propietario

01:21:41.740 --> 01:21:42.340
de la taxonomía

01:21:42.340 --> 01:21:43.240
